    "picks.eyebrow": "OUR PICKS",
    "picks.title": "What María learns with.",
    "picks.intro": "PyBot is not the only way María Ángel learns. These are robots, kits and games she loves. Maybe one is fun for you too!",
    "picks.visit": "Visit the official site (new tab)",
    "picks.adultsTitle": "For grown-ups",
    "picks.adultsText": "Nobody pays us to show these, and the links go straight to each official site, with no tracking. Ages, prices and versions change, so check there before you buy. You don't need any of them to learn with PyBot.",
