    "picks.minecraftTag": "A WORLD FOR LEARNING",
    "picks.minecraftText": "The Minecraft world, made for learning. It has lessons about coding, science and more, and you can program a robot helper called the Agent with blocks or with Python.",
    "picks.osmoName": "Osmo",
    "picks.osmoTag": "TABLET + REAL PIECES",
    "picks.osmoText": "Games that mix a tablet with real pieces on the table. In Osmo Coding you line up blocks you can touch to guide a character, step by step.",
