    "thinking.in-not-inHint": "Not yet. First: is there a z in pizza? Then flip it.",
    "comparisonsIn.quizChooseTitle": "Hello, new friend",
    "comparisonsIn.quizChooseScene": "PyBot says hello to new kids: kids who are NOT in the friends list yet.\nif name ___ friends:",
    "comparisonsIn.quizChooseQuestion": "Which word goes in the gap?",
