    "cleanComments.lifeTitle": "Notes help people remember.",
    "cleanComments.lifeIntro": "People leave short notes so others know the plan or the reason.",
    "cleanComments.look1Title": "# starts a note",
    "cleanComments.look1Text": "Python skips everything after # on that line. It is only for people.",
    "cleanComments.look2Title": "Say why, not what",
