    "projectEightBall.noteText": "The ball cannot see the future. random.choice picks an answer by chance, like pulling a paper from a hat.",
    "projectEightBall.plan1Title": "The answers",
    "projectEightBall.plan1Text": "A list keeps every answer the ball can give.",
    "projectEightBall.plan2Title": "Shake the ball",
