    "projectRps.tryText": "Change range(3) to range(5) and write 5 answers. Now it is best of 5!",
    "projectRps.fixCheckTask": "paper is a good choice, but PyBot says no. A word can't be all three at once. Fix the if.",
    "projectRps.fixCheckCode": "you = input(\"rock, paper or scissors? \")\nif you == \"rock\" and you == \"paper\" and you == \"scissors\":\n    print(\"Good choice!\")\nelse:\n    print(\"That is not an option.\")",
