    "turtleArt.quizSizeCode": "square(30, \"red\")\nsquare(90, \"blue\")",
    "thinking.art-sizeSuccess": "Yes! The first value goes into size. 90 makes longer sides than 30.",
    "thinking.art-sizeHint": "Not yet. The same function gets different numbers. Which number is bigger?",
    "turtleArt.quizSizeFirst": "The red one",
    "turtleArt.quizSizeSecond": "The blue one: its size is 90",
    "turtleArt.quizSizeSame": "They are the same size",
    "turtleArt.quizSizeTitle": "Two sizes",
    "turtleArt.quizSizeQuestion": "Which square is bigger?",
    "turtleArt.quizColorsCode": "t.color(\"black\", \"yellow\")\nt.begin_fill()\nt.circle(40)\nt.end_fill()",
    "thinking.art-colorsSuccess": "Right! color(pen, fill): the first color draws the edge, the second paints the inside.",
    "thinking.art-colorsHint": "Not yet. In color() with two colors, the first one is the pen.",
    "turtleArt.quizColorsRight": "A black edge, yellow inside",
    "turtleArt.quizColorsSwap": "A yellow edge, black inside",
    "turtleArt.quizColorsBlack": "All black",
    "turtleArt.quizColorsTitle": "Pen and fill",
    "turtleArt.quizColorsQuestion": "What does the circle look like?",
    "turtleArt.quizNoFillCode": "t.color(\"black\", \"green\")\nt.begin_fill()\nfor i in range(4):\n    t.forward(60)\n    t.left(90)",
    "thinking.art-nofillSuccess": "Yes! The lines still appear, but the paint pours in only at end_fill().",
    "thinking.art-nofillHint": "Not yet. begin_fill() starts the shape to paint. Which line pours the paint in?",
    "turtleArt.quizNoFillGreen": "A green square",
    "turtleArt.quizNoFillEmpty": "A square with no paint inside",
    "turtleArt.quizNoFillNothing": "Nothing at all",
    "turtleArt.quizNoFillTitle": "A missing line",
    "turtleArt.quizNoFillQuestion": "There is no end_fill(). What do you see?",
    "turtleArt.quizGotoCode": "t.penup()\nt.goto(100, 50)\nt.pendown()",
    "thinking.art-gotoSuccess": "Right! goto(x, y): x is left and right, y is up and down. The middle is (0, 0).",
    "thinking.art-gotoHint": "Not yet. The first number moves sideways, the second moves up or down.",
    "turtleArt.quizGotoRight": "100 steps right and 50 up from the middle",
    "turtleArt.quizGotoUp": "100 steps up and 50 right",
