    "thinking.art-penSuccess": "Yes! goto() walks straight to the spot. With the pen down it leaves a line, so we lift it first.",
    "thinking.art-penHint": "Not yet. Nothing lifted the pen. What happens when the turtle moves with the pen down?",
    "turtleArt.quizPenNever": "No, goto() never draws",
    "turtleArt.quizPenYes": "Yes, the pen is down, so it draws a line there",
    "turtleArt.quizPenCircle": "It draws a circle",
    "turtleArt.quizPenTitle": "goto with the pen down",
