    "thinking.art-fix-fillSuccess": "Yes! t.end_fill() after the loop pours the yellow paint into the square.",
    "thinking.art-fix-fillHint": "Not yet. Every begin_fill() needs a partner at the end of the shape.",
    "turtleArt.fixFillCode": "import turtle\nt = turtle.Turtle()\n\ndef square(size, fill):\n    t.color(\"black\", fill)\n    t.begin_fill()\n    for i in range(4):\n        t.forward(size)\n        t.left(90)\n\nsquare(120, \"yellow\")\n",
    "turtleArt.fixFillTask": "The square should be painted yellow, but the paint never pours in. Add the missing line.",
    "thinking.art-fix-sunSuccess": "Yes! def only keeps the steps. The call sun() at the end makes the turtle draw them.",
    "thinking.art-fix-sunHint": "Not yet. The function is ready, but nobody calls it. Add a line with its name and ( ).",
    "turtleArt.fixSunCode": "import turtle\nt = turtle.Turtle()\nturtle.bgcolor(\"lightblue\")\n\ndef move(x, y):\n    t.penup()\n    t.goto(x, y)\n    t.pendown()\n\ndef sun():\n    t.color(\"orange\", \"gold\")\n    t.begin_fill()\n    t.circle(50)\n    t.end_fill()\n\nmove(60, 40)\n",
    "turtleArt.fixSunTask": "PyBot moved the turtle to the sky, but no sun appears. Make the sun show up.",
    "thinking.art-fix-treesSuccess": "Yes! The parameter x tells the function where to plant the tree, so tree(80) plants it on the right.",
    "thinking.art-fix-treesHint": "Not yet. The number in the call becomes x. Which number puts the tree at x = 80?",
